{
  "id": "ep033",
  "duration": 50.186,
  "beats": [
    {
      "start": 0.08,
      "end": 2.274,
      "text": "No nation can ever own the Moon.",
      "asset": {
        "source": "Wikimedia Commons",
        "title": "Buzz Aldrin by Neil Armstrong.jpg",
        "credit": "Neil Armstrong",
        "license": "Public domain",
        "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Buzz_Aldrin_by_Neil_Armstrong.jpg"
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 2.267,
          "kind": "card",
          "motion": "camera"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 2.274,
      "end": 10.819,
      "text": "During the intense geopolitical tensions of the Cold War, the United States and the Soviet Union faced a dangerous new frontier.",
      "asset": {
        "source": "Wikimedia Commons",
        "title": "Atlas ICBM Launch--'(no text on envelope or negative) (16069937516).jpg",
        "credit": "SDASM Archives",
        "license": "Public domain",
        "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Atlas_ICBM_Launch--%27(no_text_on_envelope_or_negative)_(16069937516).jpg"
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "start": 2.267,
          "end": 6.533,
          "kind": "card",
          "motion": "camera"
        },
        {
          "start": 6.533,
          "end": 10.833,
          "kind": "detail",
          "motion": "camera"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 10.819,
      "end": 20.764,
      "text": "On January 27, 1967, rival superpowers opened the Outer Space Treaty for signature in Washington, London, and Moscow.",
      "asset": {
        "source": "Wikimedia Commons",
        "title": "Signing Outer Space Treaty.jpg",
        "credit": "ITU",
        "license": "CC BY 2.0",
        "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Signing_Outer_Space_Treaty.jpg"
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "start": 10.833,
          "end": 20.767,
          "kind": "card",
          "motion": "camera"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 20.764,
      "end": 29.109,
      "text": "This foundational agreement strictly bans countries from placing nuclear weapons or weapons of mass destruction in Earth orbit.",
      "asset": {
        "source": "Wikimedia Commons",
        "title": "Sputnik 1.jpg",
        "credit": "U.S. Air Force photo",
        "license": "Public domain",
        "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Sputnik_1.jpg"
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "start": 20.767,
          "end": 29.1,
          "kind": "cover",
          "motion": "camera"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 29.109,
      "end": 38.659,
      "text": "The treaty explicitly forbids claiming sovereignty over any celestial body and legally designates outer space as the province of all mankind.",
      "asset": {
        "source": "Wikimedia Commons",
        "title": "Buzz Aldrin and the U.S. Flag on the Moon (9460188482).jpg",
        "credit": "NASA/Apollo 11",
        "license": "Public domain",
        "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Buzz_Aldrin_and_the_U.S._Flag_on_the_Moon_(9460188482).jpg"
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "start": 29.1,
          "end": 33.867,
          "kind": "card",
          "motion": "camera"
        },
        {
          "start": 33.867,
          "end": 38.667,
          "kind": "detail",
          "motion": "camera"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 38.659,
      "end": 44.804,
      "text": "Yet remarkably, the treaty does not explicitly ban conventional military weapons in space.",
      "asset": {
        "source": "Wikimedia Commons",
        "title": "Tethered asteroid.png",
        "credit": "nasa",
        "license": "Public domain",
        "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Tethered_asteroid.png"
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "start": 38.667,
          "end": 44.8,
          "kind": "card",
          "motion": "camera"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 44.804,
      "end": 49.836,
      "text": "This Cold War relic keeps the heavens peaceful because no nation can ever own the Moon.",
      "asset": {
        "source": "Wikimedia Commons",
        "title": "Buzz Aldrin by Neil Armstrong.jpg",
        "credit": "Neil Armstrong",
        "license": "Public domain",
        "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Buzz_Aldrin_by_Neil_Armstrong.jpg"
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "start": 44.8,
          "end": 50.2,
          "kind": "card",
          "motion": "camera"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
